{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026AnsuaYL3yu1793260620.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>行政長官李家超表示，政治任命團隊要承擔政治責任，綜合考慮多方面因素，考慮到大火發生在宏福苑，是房屋局轄下房屋署獨立審查組的負責管理範圍，雖然火災不涉及房屋局局長個人犯錯，但房屋局局長應承擔政治責任，決定接受房屋局局長何永賢請辭。</p><p></p><p>事件問題開端是圍標，政府將訂立針對圍標刑事罪行，成立跨部門團隊打擊圍標工程，改革樓宇維修運作以及運作機制，建立中央數據系統及投訴機制。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T08:42:03.785591+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":182,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T07:36:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T17:38:11.963626+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T08:38:23.193804+00:00","content_hash":"dc73adbf4b409f78b48db325fc239046f8ebb695abf5ab491b69a558df7700e6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T08:42:03.785591+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}